{
  "_what": "What the sales contract builder knows about the person's own business, and what it sets up after a deal is paid. Read by src/sales-contract-builder.mjs (tool:manage-sales-contracts operation `resources`, and the follow-ups `send` sets) and by the builder screen (src/workspace/sales-contract-builder-surface.tsx). `sources`: each one read of the person's own data. `read.from` names one of the readers the account owner hands in (tool: a Workshop tool run with the person's own connection; action: one of their account actions; lists: their lists whose rows are the named record types or the named list ids; workflows: their saved workflows), `items` is the path to the list in the answer, `keep` tests a row must pass, `each` maps a row's fields to the builder's (paths into the row, `0` for a list's first item), `group` is the builder choice it fills, `needs_connection` is the vendor whose connection the read needs. A new source is one row. `after_payment.trigger` is the person's own rule `when` for a paid deal (the contract's id is added to it); `after_payment.steps` are the follow-ups the builder offers, each a Workshop tool run by a rule when the deal is paid (`on: \"paid\"`) or by a schedule some days after it is sent (`on: { after_days, at }`). Words in braces in a step's input are filled when the deal is sent: {to}, {contract_name}, {contract_id}, {address}. `words_for` names the plain words the builder shows for what a rule measures (`metrics`), what a performance payment waits for (`events`) and what access can depend on (`conditions`); the id is what the deal keeps. `screens` names the screens the builder opens: `connect` where a payment service or list is connected, `automations` where the person sees the rules and schedules a deal set.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "stripe-prices",
      "group": "offers",
      "label": "Your offers on Stripe",
      "needs_connection": "stripe",
      "read": {
        "from": "tool",
        "tool_id": "tool:stripe-events-list_prices",
        "input": {}
      },
      "items": [
        "data"
      ],
      "keep": [
        {
          "path": [
            "active"
          ],
          "equals": true
        },
        {
          "path": [
            "product",
            "active"
          ],
          "equals": true
        }
      ],
      "each": {
        "id": [
          "id"
        ],
        "label": [
          "product",
          "name"
        ],
        "detail": [
          "product",
          "description"
        ],
        "picture": [
          "product",
          "images",
          0
        ],
        "amount_cents": [
          "unit_amount"
        ],
        "currency": [
          "currency"
        ],
        "interval": [
          "recurring",
          "interval"
        ],
        "interval_count": [
          "recurring",
          "interval_count"
        ]
      },
      "source": {
        "url": "https://docs.stripe.com/api/prices/list",
        "read_on": "2026-10-02"
      }
    },
    {
